# Written by hand: the pieces no other log uses. A solar plant (ADR 0041), a corner of a
# zoned block painted back to no zone (ADR 0014), and fires turned off and then on again
# (ADR 0053).
sim-game command log 1
seed 4
grid 4 4
0 spawn 40
50 fill 50 50 residential-low
50 fill 170 50 commercial-low
100 plant 440 300 solar
400 fires off
800 paint 10 10 60 60 none
1200 fires on
end 3000
expect hash a2da9b8623da153d population 25 buildings 13 trips 73
